 "text": "-->\nAuditor | deuelcountysd\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nWelcome to Deuel County, South Dakota\nHOME\nDeuel County Commissioners\n2026 Commissioner Meetings\nArchived Commissioner Meeting Minutes\nList of County Offices\nAuditor\nClerk of Courts\nCommunity Health Nurse\nDirector of Equalization\nEmergency Management\n4-H Youth Program\nHighway Dept.\nICAP\nPlanning and Zoning\n2026 Zoning Meetings\nArchived Zoning Board Minutes\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff's Office\nState's Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service Officer\nWeed Supervisor\nContact/More info\nCounty Job Opening\nCourthouse History\nTown & Township Contact Information\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nAuditor\nThe County Auditor is an elected official who serves as the county's business manager and accountant. The Auditor is responsible for commissioners proceedings, agendas and records, accounting records, revenue and expense reports, voter registration and elections. Businesses may apply for county liquor licenses with the Auditor. The Auditor also figures real estate and mobile home taxes and handles county bid lettings. In many cases, the Auditor also manages medical indigent claims. The Auditor and Treasurer work in conjunction to pay county bills. The Auditor also serves as the election supervisor and is in charge of all Primary and General county wide elections.\nVoting Information\nMail ORIGINAL signed forms to:\nDeuel County Auditor\nPO Box 616\nClear Lake, SD 57226\nDeuel County Precinct Map\nCommission District Map\nPlease visit the SD Secretary of State website for any other information.\n​\nhttps://sdsos.gov/elections-voting/voting/default.aspx\nVoter Registration Form\nSD Absentee Voter Application\nCourtney Parker\nAuditor\nKristine Guttormsson\nDeputy\nGail Krause\nPart Time Deputy\nPO Box 616\n408 4th St. West\nClear Lake, SD 57226\nPhone 605-874-2312\nHours\nMonday-Friday: 8 a.m.- 5 p.m.\nClosed all state & federal holidays\nOffice located on the second floor of the Courthouse.\nauditor@deuel.sdcounty.gov\nImportant Documents\nDeuel County Audit 2024-2023.pdf\nClick here to\ngo HOME .\nCourthouse hours\n8:00 a.m. -5:00 p.m.\nClosed weekends and\nall state and federal holidays\n​\nCourthouse address\n408 4th Street West\nClear Lake, SD 57226\n© 2018 by Deuel County Proudly created with Wix.com\nPlease contact the specific office with your questions or concerns by clicking on the CONTACT US link below.\n​\nCONTACT US\nbottom of page",
